{"kind":"rss","id":"wxmp:channel:gh_e59ba9dfaa66","title":"知乎日报","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5MDM4MDExNQ==&mid=2832658904&idx=1&sn=ae4be4ffb1b62d3338528665309e964a&chksm=8a9e79cb580b5bb5a3eacc2ca79f76c6b8bd4bfe2ebb97aba03198b900da893fbdaa4e199f6f&scene=126&sessionid=1795563326#rd","description":"知乎官方订阅号，每日精选知乎热门、有趣内容","language":"zh-cn","extra":{"view":"timeline","show_thumbnails":true,"proxy_images":true,"headers":{"referer":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"tags":["微信公众号"]},"author":{"name":"知乎日报","uri":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx.qlogo.cn%2Fmmhead%2FUOCHvzUGAIWg6z2Qs1yTHicbpqJwAUFRtJ5nhXPMb35XhGb6OESOg9OianbhYibThkZQiclOv5GN4z8%2F0","updated":"2026-11-24T12:03:34.000Z","items":[{"id":"wxmp:MjM5MDM4MDExNQ%3D%3D:2832658904:1","title":"高赞丨古人为什么会创造出黄泉、冥界和阴间这些想象世界？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5MDM4MDExNQ==&mid=2832658904&idx=1&sn=ae4be4ffb1b62d3338528665309e964a&chksm=8a9e79cb580b5bb5a3eacc2ca79f76c6b8bd4bfe2ebb97aba03198b900da893fbdaa4e199f6f&scene=126&sessionid=1795563326#rd","description":"古代和现在，人们对死后世界的想象跟现在完全不一样？","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FkrSqjDRWFlHA52BOLT338N8mOIzMsPHsernF5HFSyE3gDZfjmq0cEEmeWBZ6IiaHvS01p2THQO0gSwUx4uHXRQic7ERcNXictnAucPE9madgNc%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-24T12:03:34.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MjM5MDM4MDExNQ%3D%3D:2832658904:2","title":"人文丨你知道哪些「有故事」的地名？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5MDM4MDExNQ==&mid=2832658904&idx=2&sn=de6330f6919389fee251dbf9f4e21446&chksm=8ac9295f6e460134e2c171ce1434620e37a8819f06ac9cb722fb745cf7f5ba7f3be2572d89ad&scene=126&sessionid=1795563326#rd","description":"名字背后，是一代人的苦难、坚守与开拓。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FkrSqjDRWFlFTRs5HcvCYNGvL5PgknMncew9FXib3h9uapnQ7auNPUb2o2XEdtibMCB1BD2ibOZfPFxgnZv0uRticgME0pK8dyXic6kaGw6fGrbMM%2F300%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-24T12:03:34.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MjM5MDM4MDExNQ%3D%3D:2832658903:1","title":"🍂 和作家聊聊：文字如何从故土「长」出？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5MDM4MDExNQ==&mid=2832658903&idx=1&sn=82706a00b003a48df42857e29e6bfd14&chksm=8ae646dc0edbf3de68686aa696af030db4b3492a9eb211db81296d540430cd72296a7fe3b2e8&scene=126&sessionid=1795563326#rd","description":"有些字不是写出来的，是从土里长出来的。\n\n它们带着泥土的腥气、灶台的烟火味、田埂上的乡音，这便是地域文学。\n​​知乎人文邀请了 5 位从故土汲取灵感的作家，​共同发起风土季「土地里长出来的文字」文学单元。\n\n@​​石一枫 ｜在北京长大、也写北京，记录这座城经历时代变迁的样子​​\n@韩云 ｜天津卫三代「大了」，把卫嘴子、人情与规矩变成笔下的故事 ​​\n@贝多叶  ｜内蒙古草原上的狐狸、风与怪物都是她的邻居​​\n@修新羽 ｜青岛结冰的海、旧城区的巷子，都是文学灵感​​\n@年微漾 ｜风物、方言、旧事，都是诗歌的韵脚🧩 \n\n期待你的分享，让每一片土地上的文字，都被看见。\n\n知乎搜索「风土季」，一起在字里行间，认识一个地方！","content":"<p>有些字不是写出来的，是从土里长出来的。<br /><br />它们带着泥土的腥气、灶台的烟火味、田埂上的乡音，这便是地域文学。<br />​​知乎人文邀请了 5 位从故土汲取灵感的作家，​共同发起风土季「土地里长出来的文字」文学单元。<br /><br />@​​石一枫 ｜在北京长大、也写北京，记录这座城经历时代变迁的样子​​<br />@韩云 ｜天津卫三代「大了」，把卫嘴子、人情与规矩变成笔下的故事 ​​<br />@贝多叶  ｜内蒙古草原上的狐狸、风与怪物都是她的邻居​​<br />@修新羽 ｜青岛结冰的海、旧城区的巷子，都是文学灵感​​<br />@年微漾 ｜风物、方言、旧事，都是诗歌的韵脚🧩 <br /><br />期待你的分享，让每一片土地上的文字，都被看见。<br /><br />知乎搜索「风土季」，一起在字里行间，认识一个地方！</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FkrSqjDRWFlGK4wKlrtPASOF7hMaJMsoJzWibWicCDWS9CKm1HJPaj0hq5ZYfEJD8mX06ckAGd4nIcMOUlKbucCDSVrysLDiaGzAibrKJuIZfuDY%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FkrSqjDRWFlFJFV8NVECjYia9Z5Sgz11icq8fetmFxdyFo2nc2bUa3vPn7yNuY7VQrXmWDktia2waPKHVwaX4rvLzervFicac76huZwXUBmuiaZY0%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FkrSqjDRWFlFwpbv7MPF4MVx0gtLMM7WSTFkicWkalIzDN1WSsbnUI35z8tvpBRsLqCOHoNlMRaYYvncaibmGrSlw2eCaegm4bR0rF3lSGmPlI%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FkrSqjDRWFlFTr4xHpN8wOv